- <a href="https://github.com/arpitakumari0866-hash/Excel-project-hub/blob/main/Dashboard%203.xlsx">Dashboard view</a>

🚀 Features
Total Sales Revenue Analysis
Regional Sales Performance Tracking
Product-wise Sales Comparison
Salesperson Performance Evaluation
Interactive Filters and Slicers
Dynamic Charts and Visualizations
User-friendly Dashboard Layout
📂 Dataset Overview

The dataset contains transactional sales records with the following fields:

SI No
Date
Salesman
Region
Item
Quantity (Qty)
Price
Amount (Qty × Price)

🛠️ Tools Used
Microsoft Excel
Pivot Tables
Pivot Charts
Slicers
Conditional Formatting
Excel Formulas
